om_copylink)\n\n## 全网最全最贴心且免费：600+即梦AI中文艺术字提示词库\n- [600+即梦AI中文艺术字提示词库（永久免费，持续更新）](https://zez4fk9f43.feishu.cn/sheets/JFaAsNns1hXu9Jt9HfjcXEu0nvb?from=from_copylink)\n\n## 个人私藏整理高效创作AIGC工具箱\n- [个人私藏整理高效创作AIGC工具箱（访问需申请授权）](https://zez4fk9f43.feishu.cn/docx/D2Hgd4vd3o2YENxy5t9cRsAMnnc?from=from_copylink)\n\n## 即梦11万全网最贴心全系统教程云文档，适合所有人！\n- [即梦11万全网最贴心全系统教程云文档（访问需申请授权）](https://zez4fk9f43.feishu.cn/docx/HEKPd7S3yobdLPxtzaUcsCTCnig?from=from_copylink)\n\n\n## ❤ Qwen-Edit-Plus（Qwen_2509）_多图编辑工作流\n\n\n1.支持通过提示词来控制单人图片中人物的姿势\n\n2.支持通过提示词对图片中的人物进行风格化转换\n\n3.支持多图编辑-例如换装\n\n4.支持多图编辑-例如鞋帽，产品等的穿戴展示\n\n5.高度的人物一致性保持\n\n\n+V交流：ruan_xudong\n\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "ABOUT ME", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [540.33056640625, 651.4095458984375], "pos": [-120.08930206298828, 2559.203369140625], "id": 180, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.26.13", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [410.4780243792176, -2470.2651459466715], "scale": 1.167184107045005}}, "groups": [{"color": "#8A8", "font_size": 100, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "阮旭东AIGC：Qwen-Edit-Plus（Qwen_2509）_多图编辑工作流 ——🌍微信：ruan_xudong  ♻️+V进AI学习交流群", "bounding": [-118.82154846191406, 1192.98486328125, 5659.412109375, 135.39295959472656]}, {"color": "#8A8", "font_size": 80, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "——————🤨无论学习还是工作🧰开箱即用🧰对你有帮助, 请点赞👍关注🐧收藏🐻谢谢🐲", "bounding": [-118.78901672363281, 1334.9658203125, 5659.66796875, 109.20062255859375]}, {"color": "#A88", "font_size": 50, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "扫描加作者为好友", "bounding": [-120.969482421875, 4201.30322265625, 414.93731689453125, 740.9391479492188]}], "links": [[276, 150, 0, 145, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [277, 152, 0, 146, 0, "LATENT"], [278, 147, 0, 146,